            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Antonio Vivaldi</strong><br>\nAntonio Vivaldi was born on March 4, 1678, in Venice, Italy. He was baptized immediately after his birth, which was customary due to \"danger of death\" which often meant the infant was in poor health. His father, Giovanni Battista Vivaldi, was a professional violinist who taught Antonio to play the violin. Together, they toured Venice playing the violin, which helped the young Antonio develop a passion for music.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Vivaldi's Health and Priesthood</strong><br>\nVivaldi suffered from a condition he referred to as \"strettezza di petto,\" which was likely some form of asthma. This did not stop him from becoming an ordained priest in 1703. However, due to his health issues, he soon withdrew from active clerical duties. He was nicknamed \"il Prete Rosso\" or \"the Red Priest,\" probably because of his red hair.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Work at the Ospedale della Pietà</strong><br>\nVivaldi became a violin master at the Ospedale della Pietà, a home for foundlings in Venice, in September 1703. He wrote many of his compositions while working at the Ospedale. His music was greatly influenced by the unique talents of the female musicians who resided there, and he composed many concertos, cantatas, and sacred music for them.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
